    "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 170, Number 147 (Friday, September 20, 2024)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Ms. ROSS:\nH.R. 9720.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle I, Section 8\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nDirects NIST to initiate a process to update processes and\nprocedures for the voluntary tracking and processing of\nsecurity and safety incidents associated with artificial\nintelligence\n[Page H5562]\n</pre>",
